DATA LICENCE

The dataset used by this project is *Hotel booking demand datasets*
(Nuno Antonio, Ana de Almeida, Luis Nunes, Data in Brief 22:41-49, 2019) and
is distributed under CC BY 4.0:

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The dataset is downloaded at runtime by data/download_data.py and is not
redistributed in this repository. All personally identifying information was
already removed by the original authors.
